
                       geant4-11-03-ref-01
                       ===================

Major development/fixes included since the last development tag are:

 o Revised surface area calculation and random point sampling for G4Hype shape.
 o Added G4HadronPhysicsLEND in physics-lists to define neutron and photon
   induced processes from LEND.
 o New classes with alternative precompound model.
 o Re-instated transparency slider in visualization GUI.

---------- Reference-tag 'Release Notes' -----------

(o)  Fixes included in patch release 11.3.1

